{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_title", "source_sha256": "7d281c3099cd717346fbd4e31460ac4fb8721294f60d8e52b356220fc7c9456e", "ja": "海美とおでかけ2", "zh": "和海美出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e15e98d4ff5e5b92219ae7275c28a39fecf6105b45b354a511fa144d757910c", "ja": "海美とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和海美出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f47f0070241223a587d2a80fbc88ddcb8d117a84404f76a453eb9b9085393da", "ja": "（海美と一緒に、奥会津の大内宿までやってきた。\n歴史を感じる、素晴らしい景観だな……）", "zh": "（和海美一起来到了奥会津的大内宿。真是充满历史感的美景啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "cb6f43d339cd4b522afb67e4b4b9ed3723cdd83b4efa5fb74955f8997f6c1773", "ja": "すごい、藁葺き屋根のおうちだーっ☆\n{$P$}、これ全部お店なの？", "zh": "好厉害，是茅草屋顶的房子——☆\n{$P$}，这些全都是店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "814663e49886cfeda1ba6d50afe29e91fd02caba2f145db3551e22f82e3e1d66", "ja": "今は、お店が多いみたいだな。\n昔は半農半宿の、宿場町だったらしい。", "zh": "现在好像有很多店。\n听说以前是半农半宿的驿站街。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab91d03f128de382a0b0c50a143235156c67bacc81e9e352cbaedb3de34b9c8c", "ja": "私が大内宿に行くよって言ったら、あずささんが\nガイドブック見せてくれたんだ！", "zh": "我说要去大内宿，然后あずさ姐就给我看了旅游指南！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "d92eff7c0418f462ca8c303ee6ed2604a4105e361238c4dee4714fcd4b2c902f", "ja": "おそばとかも、おいしいらしいんだけど……\n私が食べたいのは、これ！　桃のデザート！", "zh": "听说荞麦面之类的也很好吃……\n但我想吃的是这个！桃子甜点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "992c4a13dfcb46f38b5d7c5b0b488c30c29be611da91de99ef8be1b2e8266323", "ja": "桃の旬は夏だけど……\nこの時期でも、食べられる所があるのかな？", "zh": "桃子的应季时节是夏天……\n这个时候也有能吃到桃子的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "e70425b77869f508e2f560d1fd2575a35c997333f5e1887a3ff6b2ef2ab9e110", "ja": "あっ、そっか……果物だもん、季節があるよね。\nううっ、残念ーっ！", "zh": "啊，对哦……毕竟是水果，也有季节之分呢。\n呜呜，好遗憾——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "44be81ce8644839cfc200a010b1ad5090b5782883535af0f508442c1cf060b2d", "ja": "そうだな。じゃあ桃は、夏の楽しみにして……\n今日のところは、冬の美味しいものを食べに行こう！", "zh": "是啊。那桃子就留到夏天享用……\n今天先去吃冬季的美味吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi02_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "c8b6042877329506d13ab7d0d9d7f64fdfb8b4ac6bafb25f84a1dcc09deb8533", "ja": "{$P$}……うんっ！　じゃあ\n夏になったら、絶対また来ようねっ！　約束だよーっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯！那等到了夏天，我们一定要再来哦！说好了——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
